<!--
AI-generated (Claude Code). Start of AI-generated text.

Mix Two: HUD header bar (deck_hud.xml).
  Decks 1, 3:  FX assign | stretch | key | deck badge
  Decks 2, 4:  deck badge | key | stretch | FX assign
The FX group (HudFx<N>) and the deck group (HudDeckId<N>) swap places with
the HudHdrL / HudHdrR slots; inside the deck group, key and badge swap with
HudIdL / HudIdR. Slot values are set per deck in skin.xml.
The source box (USB1 on a CDJ) is left out until the track has a property
for it.
The deck indicators: each window shows the two deck numbers of its side, in
the order 3 1 (left) and 2 4 (right). The number of the deck in the window is
lit (HudIndOn). A click on the other number (HudIndOff) toggles DeckAltKey
([Skin],left_deck_alt or [Skin],right_deck_alt), so the window changes between
deck 1 and 3 (2 and 4). HudBadgeL / HudBadgeR set the order per deck in
skin.xml. While a DDJ-800 is connected ([Skin],ddj800_connected = 1), the other
number is disabled: the controller's DECK buttons set the value.

End of AI-generated text.
-->
